<%--
This_Data_Freeze_Holes - every mutation route is closed while this.data is frozen

Backlog "this.data freeze holes": the freeze proxies had no defineProperty /
setPrototypeOf / preventExtensions traps, a property descriptor handed out the raw
nested object, and components kept on_create()'s raw objects in this.data, so
`this.state.list = this.data.list = []` let this.state.list.push() change frozen data.
--%>
<Define:This_Data_Freeze_Holes>
  <div>
    <h1>this.data freeze holes</h1>
    <Holes_Target $sid="holes" />
    <Alias_Loader $sid="loader" />
    <Warn_Target $sid="warn" />
    <div $sid="results"></div>
  </div>
</Define:This_Data_Freeze_Holes>
